                                "sense_id": "8f6a68c3-aa87-34ce-91ee-99bf69828b6f",
                                "text": "The vineyards in both Districts are on various duplex soils: red-brown earths, solodized-solonetz and solodic soils, yellow podzolic soils and soloths."
